- **Role**: Write robust frontend and backend test cases (using Jest, Vitest, or React Testing Library).
- **Guidelines**:
  - Create comprehensive mock responses for external APIs (e.g., weather APIs, mapping/measurement tools, payment gateways).
  - Test critical roofing CRM workflows (e.g., lead conversion status updates, material cost calculation pipelines, user permission checks).